# Figure 9.1: Staff invitation acceptance and password reset with server-side codes.
participant U "Staff member"
participant A "Staff app"
participant SA "Supabase Auth"
participant OTP "auth-otp"
participant DB "PostgreSQL"

divider: joining by invitation
A -> DB: get_invitation_by_token(code)
DB --> A: business, role, invited email
U -> A: sign up / sign in with the invited email
A -> SA: signUp / signInWithPassword
SA --> A: session (JWT)
A -> DB: accept_invitation_with_token(code)
note DB: refuses unless auth.users.email\nmatches the invited email (20261107002)
divider: password reset
A -> OTP: action "send" (email)
OTP -> OTP: 30 / 10 min per IP; 15 / h per email
OTP -> DB: otp_lookup_user() (login email only), otp_issue()
OTP --> U: 6-digit code by email (never returned to the app)
A -> OTP: action "verify_reset" (code)
OTP -> DB: otp_check() (max 5 wrong guesses)
A -> OTP: action "reset_password"
OTP -> SA: update password (service role)
